763608794160777", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982639_1763608797494110_9146144758691653845_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6jhjwvDGH9EQ7kNvwGuMwVq&_nc_oc=AdpV7AItXsuw5sLVyvqJ5jg-tNB53uKnBGfCBQhyf2naGoXmPQOc4Cnl9AiWdGEy0AI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0HxAUwbNE1jQY0aQDSBmlBIdu2lZlSPbQRoioTa8ystQ&oe=69F1E77A"}, "display_name": "CitrusBall", "keywords": [], "long_description": "From one backyard court to world-wide phenomenon, CitrusBall is the new sport everyone's talking about. Now the game\u2019s greatest are joining an exclusive tournament on a billionaire\u2019s mysterious private island. Who will be crowned as champion?\n\nIn CitrusBall, you select a powerful character with unique abilities to face off in a designed-for-VR sport inspired by tennis and pickleball.\n\nEarly access features:\n3 playable characters, each with a unique talent, special move, and \"game changer\"\n2 island locations to play single matches against a computer-controlled opponent\nTutorial covering basic gameplay and ability usage\n\nFuture roadmap:\n3 additional playable characters\nStory mode with new locations culminating in a boss battle\nMultiplayer", "short_description": "From one backyard court to world-wide phenomenon, CitrusBall is the new sport everyone's talking about. Now the game\u2019s greatest are joining an exclusive tournament on a billionaire\u2019s mysterious private island. Who will be crowned as champion?\n\nIn CitrusBall, you select a powerful character with unique abilities to face off in a designed-for-VR sport inspired by tennis and pickleball."}]}, "developer_name": "Smaller Steps", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citrusballgame.com/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Smaller Steps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://citrusballgame.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_c